# The staged sidecar lands here. It is a build artefact, not source.
#
# `tools/stage_sidecar.py` copies `bin/hardlylistening-server` to
# `hardlylistening-server-<target-triple>`, which is the name Tauri's `externalBin` resolves at
# build time. Committing it would put the same launcher in git twice and let the two drift.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md